; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    20    \brief Description:  Main file of BRS contains
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    21                         - Main function (called from StartUpCode and calls stack entry EcuM_Init())
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    22                         - Call of BrsHw HW initialization routines
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    23                         - 1ms handler, with support of cycle functions with several cycle times
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    24                         - Exception handling
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    25                         - Default_Init_Task, Main and Background Task which can be used by the operating system
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    26  
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    27    \attention Please note:
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    28      The demo and example programs only show special aspects of the software. With regard to the fact
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    29      that these programs are meant for demonstration purposes only, Vector Informatik liability shall be
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    30      expressly excluded in cases of ordinary negligence, to the extent admissible by law or statute.
