; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    40    REVISION HISTORY
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    41   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    42    Version   Date        Author  Description
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    43    --------  ----------  ------  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    44    01.00.00  2018-03-20  visbwa  Initial creation of new BRS code basis
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    45              2018-05-08  visbwa  Introduced support for Generic Testsuite (BRS_ENABLE_TESTSUITE_SUPPORT),
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    46                                  removed support for all other testsuites,
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    47                                  introduced BRS_ENABLE_1MS_HANDLER and brsMain_CallCounter1sec
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    48    01.00.01  2018-06-22  visbwa  Added CAN stack exclusive area workaround from former BswInit_Callout_Stubs.c
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    49    01.00.02  2018-06-25  visbwa  Added configuration check for OS_MS2TICKS_SystemTimer into BrsMain.h
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    50    01.00.03  2018-07-18  visbwa  Moved BrsHwDisableInterruptAtPowerOn() from BrsMainInit() into main()
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    51                                  (OS specifies, this has to be called before Os_Init() and for every Core)
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    52    01.00.04  2018-07-30  visbwa  Encapsuled call of BrsHwDisableInterruptAtPowerOn() with usecase != VTT
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    53    01.01.00  2018-10-08  visbwa  Changed include of BrsCfg.h into vBrsCfg.h in BrsMain.h (vBaseEnv 1.1.0)
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    54    01.01.01  2018-10-10  visbwa  Moved BrsTestsuiteInit() from BrsMainInit() into Default_Init_Task(),
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    55                                  removed usage of BRS_ENABLE_HLPTEST_SUPPORT (generic Testsuite concept!)
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    56    01.01.02  2018-11-05  visbwa  Fixed include order (Can.h previous to BrsTestsuite.h)
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    57    01.01.03  2018-11-13  visbwa  Implemented Default_Init_Tasks for projects with up to 6 Cores,
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    58                                  fixed VTT support within IdleTasks (CANoeAPI_ConsumeTicks)
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    59    01.02.00  2018-11-21  visbwa  Added testsuite callouts into every function
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    60    01.02.01  2018-11-30  visbwa  Removed include of Rte_Main.h (Rte_Start() not called any more)
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    61    01.03.00  2018-12-21  visbwa  Added call of new API Os_InitialEnableInterruptSources() within every Default_Init_Task
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    62    01.03.01  2019-03-06  visbwa  Added hint for DrvCan using infix, added wrapper for Can_30_Mcan
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    63    01.03.02  2019-06-13  vismaa  Added additional Default_Init_Task_Core6
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    64    01.03.03  2019-06-26  visbwa  Moved call of BrsMainInit() previous to call of Os_Init()
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    65    01.04.00  2019-07-02  visbwa  Enhanced FBL support (encapsulations, call of fblmain())
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    66    01.04.01  2019-07-29  visbwa  Added implementation of BrsMainExceptionStartup() for calls from assembler StartUpCode
; ..\_04_StartUp\BrsMain.c	    67    01.05.00  2019-08-08  visbwa  Implemented support for different FBL usecases Legacy, WithoutOSScheduling and
